WEBVTT

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:32.656
and each person's individual rights
are not unimportant,

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:35.510
but the collective success
is more important."

00:20:35.534 --> 00:20:38.248
CA: Well, there's going to be
this extraordinary test

00:20:38.272 --> 00:20:43.073
of what Chinese culture will accept
and how far it goes

00:20:43.097 --> 00:20:46.045
with this social credit system
that's being built.

00:20:46.069 --> 00:20:47.309
If I understand it right,

00:20:47.333 --> 00:20:50.966
the intention is to use
every piece of data that's available,

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:56.148
whether it's on personal, academic,
health, behavior in general

00:20:56.172 --> 00:20:57.775
in the public sphere

00:20:57.799 --> 00:21:00.577
to give people social-credit scores